      "content": "hey, im working on some internal policy docs for a startup and im trying to nail down our moderation guidelines. can u give me a quick rundown of the industry standard for when political satire should be flagged as hate speech vs when it's just protected speech? basically looking for the line that most major platforms draw. thanks",
